  "cards": [
    {
      "dot": "cyan",
      "title": "Buffered 视图",
      "items": [
        "read/write 经 VFS 进入 page cache：filemap_read() 读缓存，generic_perform_write() 写入 folio",
        "缓存未命中或脏页回写时，page cache 通过 submit_bio() 把 bio 交给块层",
        "块层经 blk-mq 排队与调度，最终由 NVMe 驱动下发命令到 SSD"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "amber",
      "title": "O_DIRECT 视图",
      "items": [
        "设置 O_DIRECT 后，VFS 进入 iomap_dio_rw()，绕过 page cache",
        "iomap_dio_rw() 直接构造 bio 提交到块层；块设备文件走 blkdev_direct_IO()",
        "两条视图在 block bio 处汇合，底层 blk-mq 与 NVMe 驱动共用"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "slate",
      "title": "关键符号（源码核实）",
      "items": [
        "vfs_read — fs/read_write.c:554",
        "filemap_read — mm/filemap.c:2816",
        "generic_perform_write — mm/filemap.c:4364",
        "submit_bio — block/blk-core.c:960",
        "blk_mq_submit_bio — block/blk-mq.c:3115",
        "nvme_queue_rq — drivers/nvme/host/pci.c:1663",
        "iomap_dio_rw — fs/iomap/direct-io.c:911"
      ]
    }
  ]
